# Live JSON API (optional). The JSON API is built into this app and served at /api/v1, so by default the /data "live
# API" panel reads "Connected" with no configuration. Set API_URL only to point that panel at a SEPARATE standalone API
# service (apps/api) instead — e.g. http://localhost:4000 locally, or a Railway URL like https://imbonix-api.up.railway.app.
# It is read only on the server (apps/web/src/app/api/live/route.ts), so the URL is never sent to the browser.
API_URL=

# IMBONIX AI needs no configuration. It runs entirely on-device (apps/web/src/lib/assistant.ts), answering every
# question straight from NISR's published figures — no external / pre-trained model, no API key, and no network call to
# any AI provider. There are intentionally no AI keys here; there is nothing to set.

# Language switching needs no configuration: the header switcher uses Google's free Website Translator
# (translate_a/element.js) to translate the page into Kinyarwanda or French in the browser — no API key required.
